   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Paint from a shader (Flux 2 Klein)\n\n**You need:** Flux 2 Klein 4B: `flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors` (diffusion_models), `qwen_3_4b.safetensors`\n(text_encoders), `flux2-vae.safetensors` (vae). Other names: pick them in the three loaders.\n\nThe **kubakub shader** draws stripes in the first-floor windows (`which regions` = `W_F1_*`); its `images` go to **`material`**\nof the region sampler, so the model paints its stained glass along the stripes. Try another preset with **browse the\npresets**, move its sliders with **adjust**, and queue again.\n\n- how much of the shader stays: `denoise` in the plan (0.5 = most of it, 0.9 = the composition only)\n- which moment of the shader: `material_at` on the sampler (advanced)\n- the shader as a reference instead of the start: add `reference = material` to the plan (the way Qwen Image follows it)\n- where the model may change more: connect the shader's `masks` (or another shader's) to `change`\n"
   ]
  }
 ],
